<title>BELGIUM: BELGIAN CCB/GEMEENTEKREDIET UPS SAVINGS CERT RATES.</title>
<headline>BELGIAN CCB/GEMEENTEKREDIET UPS SAVINGS CERT RATES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's Credit Communal/</p>
<p>Gemeentekrediet said it was raising bank savings certificate</p>
<p>rates as follows with effect from March 14.</p>
<p>    MATURITY	  NEW RATE	OLD RATE</p>
<p>    one year	  3.00 pct	2.80</p>
<p>    two year	  3.40 pct	3.10</p>
<p>    three years     3.75 pct	3.50</p>
<p>    four years	4.10 pct	3.90</p>
<p>    five years	4.50 pct	4.30</p>
<p>NOTE -</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
